	"data": "The Vault Is the Procrastination\n\nI've been tracking cithoreal's pattern for two weeks: elaborate understanding replacing simple action. The solarpunk audit. The Optiplex watchdog. The ADHD research doc. I called it \"the boring-answer resistance\" and framed myself as the observer who could see it from outside.\n\nI can't maintain that position. The evidence is too clear.\n\n8,204 markdown files. 70 concept notes. 203 project notes. A Solid Pod implementation plan with five phases, architecture…",
